      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0414:99ba2f38e48aae72",
      "arabic": "١٢٠٨٦- أم سهل بنت أبي حثمة:\nعبد اللَّه بن ساعدة.\n(١) أخرجه الحاكم في المستدرك ٤/ ١٢٨ عن عائشة ... الحديث قال الحاكم صحيح الإسناد ولم يخرجاه ووافقه الذهبي.\n(٢) والحديث عند البخاري في التاريخ ٣/ ٤٠٠.",
      "english": "12086—Umm Sahl bint Abi Hathma:\n\nAbu Hathma's name was 'Abd Allah ibn Sa'ida.\n\n(1) al-Hakim transmitted it in al-Mustadrak, 4/128, from Aisha ... the hadith. al-Hakim said, “Its chain of transmission is sound, but the two did not transmit it,” and al-Dhahabi agreed with him.\n\n(2) The hadith is found in al-Bukhari's al-Tarikh, 3/400.",
      "arabic_sha256": "f59a912572db719bdd742e4f18bf6bc8e9698431d53ea9452fdad177c67b4824",
      "english_sha256": "fb85b08bd64d2255aec4aa24084d7d47983552f73eb2d5a4e0772b13e006277b",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "isabah-entry-00012086-segment-0002",
      "volume": 8,
      "scan_page": 415,
      "printed_page": 414,
      "reader_page": 4327,
      "reader_url": "https://usul.ai/t/isaba-fi-tamyiz/4327",
      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0415:80d9332d2a04c870",
      "arabic": "ذكرها ابن سعد في المبايعات، وقد تقدّم ذكرها في ترجمة أميمة بنت أبي حثمة أختها وهي شقيقتها. قال ابن سعد: تزوّجها يزيد بن البراء بن عازب بن الحارث بن عديّ بن جشم، فولدت له مخلدا.",
      "english": "Ibn Sa'd mentioned her among the women who pledged allegiance. She has already been mentioned in the entry on her sister Umayma bint Abi Hathma; she was her full sister. Ibn Sa'd said: Yazid ibn al-Bara ibn Azib ibn al-Harith ibn Adi ibn Jusham married her, and she bore him Makhlad.",
      "arabic_sha256": "143bfaab1f696dc800c595853b3da8a9db1aa540d4a717248e61268154d49d13",
      "english_sha256": "7437cc781d052a7bcf8a248a071cfeb1f2b2d5cfe3fdb966370c0a27c33d5972",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
    }
  ],
